Z||000003||Beaverman||09-04-2001||11:11 AM||||Getting Error code 43. Electronic Knock sensor failure.  Fix anyone? Tach filter is brand new btw :P.  Tested it this morning.<BR>||||reg||3
Z||000004||87GTZ34||09-04-2001||02:20 PM||||That's odd they didn't put knock sensors on these cars.  I wonder if someone put in a different prom or computer.  If the 'blinks' are transposed then you're getting a 34 which would be map sensor low voltage and the computer would switch to a table value based on TPS postition.GL||||reg||1
